# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SWAP 2K26 — Frontend environment (TEMPLATE)
# Copy: cp .env.example .env  → then fill in values.
# Vite exposes ONLY variables prefixed with VITE_ to the client.
# Restart `npm run dev` after any change.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Base URL for API calls.
# Leave empty in development — the Vite dev server proxies /api → http://localhost:5002
# (see vite.config.ts). Set explicitly for production builds, e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.your-domain.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=